stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading : fetch
    Loading --> Ready : ok
    Loading --> Error : fail
    Error --> Loading : retry
    Error --> [*]
    state Ready {
        [*] --> Viewing
        Viewing --> Editing : edit
        Editing --> Saving : save
        Saving --> Viewing : saved
        Saving --> Editing : conflict
    }
    Ready --> Idle : reset
    state pick <<choice>>
    Idle --> pick
    pick --> Loading : cached
    pick --> Error : offline
    pick --> Ready : warm
    note right of Error : shows a banner
    note left of Idle : waiting for input
    Ready --> [*]
